*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
# The dedup caches are pipeline STATE, not scratch. Phase 1 ran from
# cron_runner.sh on a persistent host, so ignoring everything here was correct.
# The pipeline now runs in GitHub Actions: every run starts from a fresh
# actions/checkout, so an ignored cache file is an ABSENT cache file, load_seen()
# returns {} and the 60-day dedup has never once fired in CI. Measured
# 2026-09-16 over reports/spatial-daily/: 478 cross-day re-emissions of the same
# arXiv id, 477 of them (99.8%) inside the 60-day window the cache was supposed
# to cover. The repo is the only durable store this deployment has — track them.
!seen_arxiv_ids.json
!curated_seen.json
